{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09474","headline":"广陵行 · 韦应物","name":"广陵行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雄藩镇楚郊，地势郁迢嶢。\n双旌拥万戟，中有霍嫖姚。\n海云助兵气，宝货益军饶。\n严城动寒角，晚骑踏霜桥。\n翕习英豪集，振夺士卒骁。\n列郡何足数，趋拜等卑寮。\n日宴方云罢，人逸马萧萧。\n忽如京洛间，游子风尘飘。\n归来视宝剑，功名岂一朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}